@baseUrl = https://localhost:7000
@baseUrlHttp = http://localhost:5000

### Test Authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/test-auth
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Test Patient Creation (requires authentication)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe", 
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phone": "+1000125585",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-15",
  "gender": "Male",
  "medicalHistory": "No known allergies",
  "department": "Cardiology",
  "status": "active"
}

### Get All Patients (requires authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Register a user first (to get a token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User"
}

### Login (to get JWT token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}